# The build context is the repo root, because the package data lives outside
# Scripts/. Everything the image does not need is excluded here rather than
# shipped and then deleted — a COPY'd file stays in the layer even if a later
# RUN removes it, which matters for both image size and the malware review.

.git
.github
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.recall
*.egg-info
build
dist
.venv

# Large trees no lane reads: published-paper artifacts, genome sequence, the
# workshop material, and the archived data versions.
Papers
Genomes
Workshops
Data/PlantSEED_v1
Data/PlantSEED_v2

# Curator scratch space. Personal working files, not inputs.
Scripts/PlantSEED_v3/Curation/Curators

# Archived data versions no lane reads.
Data/PlantSEED_v2.5
